Package: phix174recoding
Title: phiX174 Codon-Recoding Fitness Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("J", "van Leuven", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "placeholder@example.com")
Description: Analysis code and data for the codon-recoding (deoptimization)
    study of bacteriophage phiX174. Includes the full R pipeline for PacBio
    counts, flask assay compilation, divergence calculation, plotting, and
    two statistical analyses: the primary mixed model (lme4) and the
    relative-fitness (same-day WT control) analyses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
